\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-bold text-white\">Client Milestone Payment</div>\n          <div class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-500\">Revenue</div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"font-mono text-emerald-400 font-bold\">+$2,400.00</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
